{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "notes": "Keywords are matched after normalisation: lowercase, Arabic diacritics removed, alef forms to bare alef, taa marbuta to haa, alef maqsura to yaa, and any run of the same letter collapsed to one (so kbeeer = kbeer, واااسع = واسع). Latin keywords match whole words or phrases; Arabic keywords match anywhere, except keyword groups whose name ends in _word (for example ar_word), which match whole words only (so بدل, instead of, does not match استبدل or بدله). Longer keywords win over shorter ones they overlap. A size keyword right after a negator (not, isnt, مش, مو, ما, mesh, ma) does not count (classify_reasons.py NEGATORS). Ties go to the earlier category in priority.",
